{
  "version": 1,
  "document": {
    "key": "omem:packages/contracts/src/code-modules.ts",
    "title": "Code Wiki 的仓库路径分组规则",
    "summary": "该模块提供一个共享、确定性的路径到模块名称映射，供 Wiki 索引与 Vue 阅读器采用同一分组口径；未命中的路径统一归入 other。",
    "category": "implementation",
    "sections": [
      {
        "key": "mapping",
        "title": "固定前缀与服务端细分",
        "body": "`moduleForPath` 按路径前缀把 Web、UI、合同、代理运行时、Lark 集成和脚本归入固定模块。[[c1]] 服务端路径另按第四个路径片段细分；位于 `apps/server/src/` 根部或缺少该片段时回退到 `server-root`。这是一套顺序敏感的字符串规则，例如 Lark 必须先于一般服务端规则匹配。"
      },
      {
        "key": "boundary",
        "title": "用途与限制",
        "body": "所有未覆盖路径返回 `other`，函数本身不读取仓库、检查文件是否存在，也不做路径正规化。[[c2]] 因而它适合让索引与阅读器稳定共享展示分组，但新增顶层目录或重命名路径时必须同步修改规则，否则内容只会进入兜底组。"
      }
    ],
    "citations": [
      {
        "key": "c1",
        "label": "共享路径分组规则",
        "reason": "支持各主要目录前缀、Lark 特例及服务端路径片段分组的具体行为。",
        "relation": "implements",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:packages/contracts/src/code-modules.ts",
          "startLine": 1,
          "endLine": 13
        },
        "quote": "/** Shared repository-path grouping for the Wiki index and Vue reader. */\nexport function moduleForPath(path: string): string {\n  if (path.startsWith(\"apps/web/\")) return \"web\";\n  if (path.startsWith(\"packages/ui/\")) return \"ui\";\n  if (path.startsWith(\"packages/contracts/\")) return \"contracts\";\n  if (path.startsWith(\"p"
      },
      {
        "key": "c2",
        "label": "未匹配路径兜底",
        "reason": "支持未知或未覆盖路径统一归入 other，并界定该函数只是字符串映射。",
        "relation": "explains",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:packages/contracts/src/code-modules.ts",
          "startLine": 8,
          "endLine": 14
        },
        "quote": "  if (path.startsWith(\"apps/server/src/\")) {\n    const parts = path.split(\"/\");\n    if (parts.length <= 4) return \"server-root\";\n    return parts[3] ?? \"server-root\";\n  }\n  if (path.startsWith(\"scripts/\")) return \"scripts\";\n  return \"other\";"
      }
    ],
    "questions": []
  },
